| `src/components/solopreneur/SolopreneurWall.vue` | Show the ticket name per row (`chatNames` + `nameOf`); add live refresh (`ticketSignature`, `ticketEventCount`, watchers, debounced silent `load({ silent })`), retry button calls `load()`. |

